   "html": "West Harvest",
   "plain": "West Harvest"
  },
  {
   "kind": "description",
   "html": "I directed branding, environmental graphics, and wayfinding for a high‑volume Fortune-50 tech campus café, creating a distinct identity and mural series, designing digital menu boards and a signage system, and managing on‑site reviews and placement approvals; the café became a stand‑out space with smooth peak‑time flows and a memorable atmosphere.",
   "plain": "I directed branding, environmental graphics, and wayfinding for a high‑volume Fortune-50 tech campus café, creating a distinct identity and mural series, designing digital menu boards and a signage system, and managing on‑site reviews and placement approvals; the café became a stand‑out space with smooth peak‑time flows and a memorable atmosphere."
  },
